# ── home_page.html — FAQ ──
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "Preguntas Frecuentes"

msgid "Do you service commercial appliances?"
msgstr "Reparan electrodomesticos comerciales?"

msgid "Yes, we service both commercial and residential appliances. Our technicians are certified to work on industrial-grade equipment and standard home appliances."
msgstr "Si, reparamos electrodomesticos comerciales y residenciales. Nuestros tecnicos estan certificados para trabajar con equipos de grado industrial y electrodomesticos estandar del hogar."

msgid "Is there a warranty on repairs?"
msgstr "Hay garantia en las reparaciones?"

msgid "All repairs come with a warranty on parts and labor. If you experience any issues within the warranty period, we will fix it at no additional cost."
msgstr "Todas las reparaciones incluyen garantia en piezas y mano de obra. Si experimentas algun problema dentro del periodo de garantia, lo repararemos sin costo adicional."

