msgstr "calificacion de 5 estrellas"

msgid "Called in the morning and they were here by noon. Fixed my refrigerator on the spot. Very professional and fair pricing."
msgstr "Llame en la manana y estaban aqui al mediodia. Repararon mi refrigerador en el momento. Muy profesional y precios justos."

msgid "Great experience with washer repair. The technician explained everything clearly and the warranty gives peace of mind."
msgstr "Excelente experiencia con la reparacion de lavadora. El tecnico explico todo claramente y la garantia da tranquilidad."

msgid "They repaired our commercial dishwasher quickly. Reasonable rates and they waived the service call fee. Highly recommend!"
msgstr "Repararon nuestro lavavajillas comercial rapidamente. Tarifas razonables y no cobraron la llamada de servicio. Altamente recomendado!"

