# home_page.html — New FAQ items
msgid "How much does appliance repair cost?"
msgstr "Cuanto cuesta la reparacion de electrodomesticos?"

#, python-format
msgid "Our diagnostic service call is $%(fee)s, which is waived when you approve the repair. Final cost depends on the appliance type and parts needed. We always provide a transparent quote before starting any work — no hidden fees."
